Subject: [PATCH] presentation: use compact navigation and reveal it on reverse
 scrolling

Shared navigation policy with Anikku 0048. Use the existing ShortNavigationBarCompact suite and show/hide animation, keep tablet rails, action modes and accessibility controls available. Opt browsing toolbars into Material3 enterAlways; the observer never consumes scroll or fling input.
